{{!-- What Stonetop has built that bends a step this season does not have.

      Every bend now hangs on the step it bends — Township on winter's 1d4+Population, Stone Wall
      under what it consumes — which is where five of them were never shown. This is what is left:
      the Golden Sapling generates +1 whenever the steading generates at all, and spring and winter
      generate nothing, so there is no step of theirs to hang it on. Headed by the STEP, so the
      heading states when it applies and no row has to.

      Never a control: an adjustment changes an arithmetic the sheet does not perform.

      Params: groups (AdjustmentGroup[]). --}}
{{#if groups.length}}
	<div class="steading-adjustments">
		{{#each groups}}
			<h5 class="steading-adjustments-head">{{localize labelKey}}</h5>
			{{> "stonetop.steading-effect-lines" lines=lines}}
		{{/each}}
	</div>
{{/if}}
